# Prismari Charm, third mode: "Return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand." Bot2's Ornithopter returns to Bot2's
# hand (its owner's; Bot1 does not get it). Bot2's Island is not a legal target (nonland): the refusal comes beside the
# positive control, the Ornithopter named on the next line. Choosing two modes is refused (choose one).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Prismari Charm
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Swamp x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Prismari Charm.Cast
! Bot1.Modes(1; 3)
Bot1.Modes(Return target nonland permanent)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Hand = Ornithopter; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp
Bot2.Battlefield = Island
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
